  "description": "A transactional outbox for Rask.Data entities: domain events marked `IOutboxEvent` are written to an `OutboxMessage` table in the **same transaction** as the change that raised them (so an event is never lost and never fires for a rolled-back change), then a background `OutboxProcessor` polls the table and publishes them through Rask.Cqrs — at-least-once, crash-safe delivery, all on the app's own database (no broker, no Redis). A source generator registers each event type for reflection-free lookup. Server-side; pairs with Rask.Data.",
